<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Token Launch Radar — The Midnight Ledger</title>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="app.css">
</head>
<body>
<header class="masthead">
  <p class="kicker">DefiLlama snapshot &middot; 14 November 2026 &middot; 758 protocols &middot; $50M floor</p>
  <h1>Token Launch Radar</h1>
  <p class="sub">Which protocols without a token are worth farming, and what a launch might be worth. A ledger, not a tip sheet: every number below is fitted from the snapshot itself.</p>
  <dl class="ledger-line" id="ledgerLine"></dl>
  <p class="proof-line">Out of sample: leave-one-out miss <b>&times;2.96</b> (51% within 3&times;) &middot; walk-forward <b>&times;2.26</b> (62% within 3&times;) &middot; flat multiple <b>&times;3.93</b> (38% within 3&times;)</p>
</header>

<nav class="tabs" aria-label="Views">
  <button class="tab active" data-view="board" type="button">The Board</button>
  <button class="tab" data-view="live" type="button">Live Tokens</button>
  <button class="tab" data-view="method" type="button">Method &amp; Proof</button>
</nav>

<section id="view-board" class="view">
  <div class="toolbar">
    <label class="search">Search <input id="q" type="search" placeholder="protocol, category, chain&hellip;" autocomplete="off"></label>
    <div class="chips" id="verdictChips" role="group" aria-label="Verdict filter">
